# Sources, replay bundles, aggregate receipts and a SHA-256 inventory are tracked.
# See reports/zen-bonsai-research-checkpoint-2026-09-21/README.md.
/reports/zen-g15-apical-completion-2026-09-20/**/*.gz
/reports/zen-g15-budgeted-ending-2026-09-20/**/*.gz
/reports/zen-g15-cadence-closure-2026-09-20/**/*.gz
/reports/zen-g15-child-planning-2026-09-20/**/*.gz
/reports/zen-g15-factor-study-2026-09-20/**/*.gz
/reports/zen-g15-length-allocation-2026-09-20/**/*.gz
/reports/zen-g15-paid-completion-2026-09-21/**/*.gz
.turbo/
.parcel-cache/
reports/test-failures/
아이디어.txt
dist.crx
